#* {{RQ:Gilbert and Sullivan Mikado|song=A More Humane Mikado|page=36|passage=The advertising '''quack''' who wearies / With tales of countless cures, / His teeth, I've enacted, / Shall all be extracted / By terrified amateurs.}}
