#* {{quote-book|en|date=1 March 2017|author=Jocelyn Samara D.|title=Rain|section=Comic 920 - '''Quack'''|sectionurl=https://rain.thecomicseries.com/comics/920/|format=webcomic|text="I don't want to get into specifics, but when I was born, my parts were considered... ambiguous.  The '''quack''' of a doctor that delivered me, had trouble assigning a gender.  So at his recommendation - and surgical intervention - I was raised as a boy."}}
# {{lb|en|figuratively|pejorative}} Any [[similar]] [[charlatan]] or [[incompetent]] [[professional]].
#* {{RQ:John Ford Fancies|page=32|passage=The very '''quaik''' of faſhions, the very ''hee'' that / VVeares a ''Steletto'' on his chinne.}}
# {{lb|en|jocular|_|slang|mildly|_|pejorative}} Any [[doctor]].
#: {{ux|en|That '''quack''' wants me to quit smoking, eat less, and start exercising. The nerve!}}

